- [x] AMPscript (variables, conditionals, loops, lookups)
- [x] SSJS (Platform.Function calls, form processing)
- [x] SQL Query Activities (segmentation, joins, Data Views)
- [x] Automation Studio (import, query, script activities, scheduling)
- [x] Journey Builder (entry sources, decision splits, wait steps, exit criteria)
- [x] Email Studio (dynamic content, personalization, testing)
