## Tip for your first week
Since you're coming from QA, lean into that as a strength rather than hiding
it: mention you built these with testability in mind (sample/edge-case data
in each DE, a way to verify each automation step, previewed emails against
multiple test profiles). That's a genuinely useful angle a pure-dev hire
often skips.
